'''Suellen Rayanne Linhares Ribeiro''' ([[Rio Claro, São Paulo|Rio Claro]], January 9, 1999<ref>{{Cite web |title=Candidata Suellen Rayanne {{!}} Eleições 2024 |url=https://www.estadao.com.br/politica/eleicoes/2024/candidatos-sp/rio-claro/vereador/suellen-rayanne-44449/?srsltid=AfmBOooMpgcaiOMRq8_-5gc5ny_nIeR66jdgfTHYKWUOF9akLrLGAvGy |access-date=March 21, 2025 |website=[[Estadão]] |language=pt-BR |archive-date=April 9, 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250409223637/https://www.estadao.com.br/politica/eleicoes/2024/candidatos-sp/rio-claro/vereador/suellen-rayanne-44449/?srsltid=AfmBOooMpgcaiOMRq8_-5gc5ny_nIeR66jdgfTHYKWUOF9akLrLGAvGy |url-status=live |date=2024|trans-title=Candidate Suellen Rayanne {{!}} Elections 2024}}</ref>), [[Pseudonym|also known]] in social medias as '''Trans de Direita''' ('''right-wing trans woman'''), is a Brazilian politician and [[internet personality]], considered one of the leading voices of the Brazilian [[LGBTQ people|LGBTQ]] rights movement.<ref name=":1">{{Cite web |date=September 10, 2024 |title=Gays bolsonaristas e evangélicos do PT: candidatos desafiam rótulos |url=https://www.metropoles.com/sao-paulo/candidatos-gays-bolsonaristas-evangelicos-pt |access-date=March 21, 2025 |website=[[Metrópoles]] |language=pt-BR|last=Trajano|first=Pedro|trans-title=Bolsonarist gays and evangelical PT members: candidates defy labels}}</ref> She gained notoriety in 2016 as a transgender woman who supported [[Jair Bolsonaro]]. Politically, she identifies as a conservative,<ref name=":2">{{Cite web |last=Costa |first=Cristyan |date=May 21, 2023 |title=O que pensa uma trans de direita? |url=https://revistaoeste.com/politica/o-que-pensa-uma-trans-de-direita/ |access-date=March 21, 2025 |website=[[Revista Oeste]] |language=pt-BR |archive-date=April 22, 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250422062238/https://revistaoeste.com/politica/o-que-pensa-uma-trans-de-direita/ |url-status=live |trans-title=What does a right-wing trans woman think?}}</ref>{{Better source needed|reason=The current source is insufficiently reliable ([[WP:NOTRS]]).|date=August 2026}} as a member of the [[Brazil Union]] party.<ref name=":1" />

== Life ==
Suellen has completed high school and lives in [[Rio Claro, São Paulo|Rio Claro]], in the interior of São Paulo state.<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |last=Costa |first=Cristyan |date=June 12, 2023 |title=Quem são e o que pensam gays, lésbicas e trans de direita |url=https://revistaoeste.com/politica/quem-sao-e-o-que-pensam-gays-lesbicas-e-trans-de-direita/ |access-date=March 21, 2025 |website=[[Revista Oeste]] |language=pt-BR |archive-date=April 22, 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250422062243/https://revistaoeste.com/politica/quem-sao-e-o-que-pensam-gays-lesbicas-e-trans-de-direita/ |url-status=live |trans-title=Who are right-wing gay, lesbian, and trans people, and what do they think?}}</ref>{{Better source needed|reason=The current source is insufficiently reliable ([[WP:NOTRS]]).|date=August 2026}}<ref>{{Cite web |date=November 30, 2024 |title=Eleições 2024: Suellen Rayanne (UNIÃO) {{!}} Candidato(a) a vereador(a) de Rio Claro-SP {{!}} Folha |url=https://www1.folha.uol.com.br/poder/eleicoes/candidatos/2024/sp/vereador/suellen-rayanne-250002138605.shtml |access-date=March 21, 2025 |website=[[Folha de S.Paulo]] |language=pt-BR |archive-date=March 21, 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250321234040/https://www1.folha.uol.com.br/poder/eleicoes/candidatos/2024/sp/vereador/suellen-rayanne-250002138605.shtml |url-status=live |trans-title=2024 Elections: Suellen Rayanne (UNION) {{!}} Candidate for City Councilor of Rio Claro-SP {{!}} Folha}}</ref>

She gained visibility on social media through her various stances against what she defines as [[Anti-gender movement|gender ideology]],<ref name=":1"/> opposing various positions held by the LGBTQ community, and rejecting the concept of a [[transgender child]].<ref name=":0"/> She advocates for the existence of only two [[gender]]s and opposes transgender women using women's restrooms, proposing the creation of a [[Unisex public toilet|third restroom]] for such situations.<ref name=":2"/>

In 2024, she ran for city council in Rio Claro as a candidate for Brazil Union, receiving only 83 votes, which were not enough to win the election.<ref>{{cite web |access-date=March 21, 2025 |date=October 7, 2024 |first=Douglas |language=pt-BR |last=Lima |title=Suellen Rayanne não é eleita vereadora por Rio Claro |url=https://observatoriog.com.br/mundo-gay/politica/suellen-rayanne-nao-e-eleita-vereadora-por-rio-claro/ |website=Observatório G |archive-date=March 21, 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250321234041/https://observatoriog.com.br/mundo-gay/politica/suellen-rayanne-nao-e-eleita-vereadora-por-rio-claro/ |url-status=live |trans-title=Suellen Rayanne was not elected councilwoman for Rio Claro}}<!-- auto-translated from Portuguese by Module:CS1 translator --></ref>

In February 2025, she attended a dinner hosted by [[Jair Bolsonaro]]'s [[Liberal Party (Brazil, 2006)|Liberal Party]] (PL), which marked the opening of the PL's 1st National Communication Seminar, as part of the party’s strategy to expand its presence on social media and strengthen its internal communication. The dinner was also attended by leading right-wing digital influencers, such as Dom Lancelotti, founder of the "Gays with Bolsonaro" movement; Nayara Thaf, president of the Conservative Student Union; and federal deputy [[Nikolas Ferreira]], as well as several key party figures, including party president [[Valdemar Costa Neto]], [[Federal Senate (Brazil)|Senate]] opposition leader [[Rogério Simonetti Marinho|Rogério Marinho]], and Jair Bolsonaro himself.<ref>{{cite journal |access-date=March 21, 2025 |date=February 20, 2025 |language=pt-BR |periodical= |title=Jantar do PL reúne o ex-presidente Bolsonaro e influenciadores de direita |url=https://www.gp1.com.br/df/distrito-federal/noticia/2025/2/20/jantar-do-pl-reune-o-ex-presidente-bolsonaro-e-influenciadores-de-direita-588267.html |archive-date=March 21, 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250321234041/https://www.gp1.com.br/df/distrito-federal/noticia/2025/2/20/jantar-do-pl-reune-o-ex-presidente-bolsonaro-e-influenciadores-de-direita-588267.html |url-status=live |last=Pinheiro|first=Rauena|journal=GP1|trans-title=PL dinner brings together former president Bolsonaro and right-wing influencers}}<!-- auto-translated from Portuguese by Module:CS1 translator --></ref>

